# Cost-free by default

- Never create hidden or surprise costs for the Founder (GitHub Actions overages, paid SaaS tiers, paid APIs, paid Vercel add-ons, paid domains unless explicitly requested).
- Prefer free tiers and local/open alternatives: free GitHub Actions minutes, Vercel Hobby, Supabase free/EU, Sentry free, local `verify:*` scripts instead of paid CI minutes when possible.
- Keep GitHub budgets at $0 with stop-on-limit for metered products; do not raise spending limits without explicit Founder approval.
- Before enabling any paid feature, flag cost and ask. If a free path exists, use it.
- Lean CI: avoid Playwright/heavy jobs on every push; use workflow_dispatch or local verify suites.
